{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "suite": "container_digest",
  "title": "PFB 内容摘要（免密完整性）",
  "description": "contentDigest = SHA256(文件[48..长度-32])：覆盖盐起到密文区末尾；固定头的完整性由 headerCrc32 负责。覆盖边界本身是契约。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "container.digest.verify.ok",
      "kind": "container.digest.verify",
      "title": "未改动文件：contentDigest 一致",
      "milestone": "M1",
      "input": {
        "hex": ""
      },
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "value": {
          "matches": true,
          "computedDigestHex": "69cc566542ed1425e4f416ad01798399634ab8d53d63d38775eb2c7645aaa100",
          "declaredDigestHex": "69cc566542ed1425e4f416ad01798399634ab8d53d63d38775eb2c7645aaa100"
        }
      },
      "notes": "免密完整性的正向基线：损坏判定先于密码校验 —— 用户还没输密码就知道文件坏了，而不是输完密码才被告知「打不开」。",
      "tags": [
        "security"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "container.digest.verify.ciphertext-tampered",
      "kind": "container.digest.verify",
      "title": "密文区改一字节 → 摘要不符（文件损坏，无需密码即判定）",
      "milestone": "M1",
      "input": {
        "hex": ""
      },
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "value": {
          "matches": false,
          "computedDigestHex": "51f9b4b1aacd95f38a2e90214ed237decfab13efebf21c13980503b01e6ca0fc",
          "declaredDigestHex": "69cc566542ed1425e4f416ad01798399634ab8d53d63d38775eb2c7645aaa100"
        }
      },
      "notes": "这是「损坏」与「密码错」能区分的全部依据：摘要对密文计算，不泄漏明文信息，却能在拿密码之前拦住损坏的文件。",
      "tags": [
        "security"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "container.digest.verify.header-tampered-outside-coverage",
      "kind": "container.digest.verify",
      "title": "固定头改一字节 → 摘要仍相符（固定头是 CRC 的辖区）",
      "milestone": "M1",
      "input": {
        "hex": ""
      },
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "value": {
          "matches": true,
          "computedDigestHex": "69cc566542ed1425e4f416ad01798399634ab8d53d63d38775eb2c7645aaa100",
          "declaredDigestHex": "69cc566542ed1425e4f416ad01798399634ab8d53d63d38775eb2c7645aaa100"
        }
      },
      "notes": "覆盖边界本身是契约：contentDigest 覆盖 [48..长度-32)，固定头由 headerCrc32 负责。两者的分工被这条向量显式钉死 —— 若有人把摘要改成覆盖整文件或漏掉变量区，这里会立刻变红。",
      "tags": [
        "security",
        "format"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "container.digest.verify.trailer-tampered",
      "kind": "container.digest.verify",
      "title": "文件尾声明值被改 → 不符，计算值不变",
      "milestone": "M1",
      "input": {
        "hex": ""
      },
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "value": {
          "matches": false,
          "computedDigestHex": "69cc566542ed1425e4f416ad01798399634ab8d53d63d38775eb2c7645aaa100",
          "declaredDigestHex": "69cc566542ed1425e4f416ad01798399634ab8d53d63d38775eb2c7645aaa101"
        }
      },
      "notes": "两个值都要比对：只断言布尔值的话，「无论如何都返回 false」的实现能让全部反例通过。",
      "tags": [
        "security"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
